# Copy this file to cookies.txt and paste your HackTheBox Academy session cookie.
#
# How to get it:
#   1. Log into https://academy.hackthebox.com in your browser.
#   2. Open DevTools (F12) -> Application (or Storage) -> Cookies
#      -> https://academy.hackthebox.com
#   3. Copy the value of the `htb_academy_session` cookie. The XSRF-TOKEN
#      cookie is helpful too.
#   4. Paste the full Cookie header below as a SINGLE line, e.g.:
#
#          htb_academy_session=eyJpdiI6...; XSRF-TOKEN=eyJpdiI6...
#
# This file is gitignored — it will never be committed.

htb_academy_session=PASTE_VALUE_HERE; XSRF-TOKEN=PASTE_VALUE_HERE
